      "raw": "<p>So this is one of those questions about the meaning of &quot;turn&quot;. The text on Annubis states, &quot;The first time a non-environment card is destroyed each turn, this card deals the non-environment target with the second highest hp 2 infernal damage.&quot; Does &quot;turn&quot; mean environment turn, villain turn, and hero turn? Or does it mean the overall turn--i.e., the &quot;tunr&quot; that starts with the villain and ends with the environment?</p>",
