    {
      "id": 38905,
      "name": "TheJayMann",
      "username": "TheJayMann",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-20T23:07:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What you refer to as \"the overall turn\" is actually defined as a round.&nbsp; A round consists of a villain turn, all hero turns in turn order, and an environment turn.&nbsp; Also, if something refers to a turn without qualifying it, it refers to any turn.&nbsp; In this case, the first time every villain, hero,&nbsp;and environment turn where a non-environment&nbsp;card is destroyed, Anubis deals damage.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:12:38.745Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
