    {
      "id": 38908,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-21T05:52:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And also to clarify each hero has their own turn. So if you have four heroes in battle and two heroes destroy a environment card on their respective turns then Anubis will activate on both of their turns. So it's best if you want to destroy a lot of environments that you leave it up to one hero to destroy as many as possible so that way Anubis only strikes once, unless of course a villian will be the second highest which is even better.</p>",
